        "subject": "LU-20689 utils: Restore bytes as llsom_sync -c default unit",
        "message": "LU-20689 utils: Restore bytes as llsom_sync -c default unit\n\nLU-16723 changed the default unit of \"-c\" from bytes to MiB, so\n\"-c 50\" became 50MiB and a value below 100 was no longer taken as\na percentage of total memory.  Restore bytes as the default unit.\n\nFixes: 21080400f90e (\"LU-16723 libcfs: refactor parser to be simpler\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity env=ONLY=56Fd\nSigned-off-by: Xiao Yang <xyang@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5\nChange-Id: Ia2e7053f20a4b775dad2a716ac3c09459fa849db\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
